# Winterspring (58-59): the last Horde visit of Winterspring, then a sweep of the hand-ins left in
# the Eastern Kingdoms, Thunder Bluff, Feralas, Tanaris and Un'Goro Crater, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/winterspring_58_59.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Winterspring, area 618).
# The guide's quest list is section 23 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
# Carried in: Rabine Saturna (1123), from Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff (Un'Goro Crater 53-54);
# Glyphed Oaken Branch (4987), from Mulgris Deepriver in the Western Plaguelands (56-58).
# Left to Silithus (59-60): Wasteland (1124) and A Reliquary of Purity (5527), from Rabine Saturna;
# Are We There, Yeti? (5163): taken from Umi in Everlook, Legacki scared there, Sprinkle and Quixxil
# on the way out (Gadgetzan, Marshal's Refuge), and left to Silithus (59-60), which ends with a
# flight from Moonglade to Everlook to hand it in.
# It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962): Linken's last task, after Linken's Adventure, done at Fire
# Plume Ridge before the ride to Silithus.
# Left out: Tinkee Steamboil (4907): it opens only once Return to Tinkee is handed in at Flame Crest,
# starts back in Everlook and leads to a Blackrock Spire dungeon quest. Wrath of the Blue Flight
# (5161, 5162): they need The Matron Protectorate, given by Awbee inside Blackrock Spire. Red Bag
# Blues (84146) and Bookin' it Back (84212): Red Bag Blues needs Frosty Favors (84138, D.E.L.T.A lab
# in southern Tanaris, on no guide's list) and Bookin' it Back needs Poacher's Den (84211), a
# warrior-only quest in the Burning Steppes.
# Data note: outof.games lists A Little Luck (6606) before Luck Be With You (969); 6606 is removed
# from the game and the data gives 969 no prerequisite, so 969 is taken straight from Mau'ari.
#
# The route: Undercity and the zeppelin to Orgrimmar (the auction house, the hearthstone); Trull
# Failbane at Bloodvenom Post; Timbermaw Hold and Rabine Saturna in Moonglade; the tunnel to
# Winterspring, Salfa and Donova Snowden; Everlook and the mail to Mount Hyjal; the Winterfall
# village, the yetis and the owlbeasts east of Everlook; west again to Donova, Salfa and Timbermaw,
# and Bloodvenom Post; the south (Brumeran, Hailspite, the Frostmaul giants); the north (the
# Shardtooth camp, Shy-Rotam); Bloodvenom Post and the Emerald Sanctuary; Undercity and Flame Crest;
# the hearthstone to Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, Camp Mojache, Tanaris and Marshal's Refuge.

guide Winterspring (58-59)
faction horde
levels 58 59
carry 1123 4987 8276
leave 1124 5163 5527 8276
next Silithus (59-60)

# Orgrimmar ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Azshara
fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 8610
tip The last guide ends at Valormok in Azshara.
map Orgrimmar
bind 6929
tip The hearthstone brings you back here from the Burning Steppes near the end of the guide.
train 3353 3352 3401 6014 3344 5882 3326
tip Paladins and druids have no trainer here: paladins train in Undercity or Thunder Bluff, druids in Thunder Bluff or Moonglade.
accept 7492
tip Warcaller Gorlach walks the Valley of Strength. Talo Thornhoof in Feralas takes it near the end of the guide.
ah 6031.1 npc 8673
ah 7823.1 npc 8673
tip Runecloth: 30 for Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold and 60 for Rumstag in Thunder Bluff, 90 in all. The Winterfall furbolgs drop a lot of it, so buy only what you won't farm.
ah 7820.1 npc 8673
ah 7821.1 npc 8673
ah 7822.1 npc 8673
tip Rumstag Proudstrider in Thunder Bluff takes 60 Wool, 60 Silk and 60 Mageweave Cloth at the end of the guide. Nothing in Winterspring drops them: buy them here or bring your own.
fly "Bloodvenom Post, Felwood" npc 3310

# Bloodvenom Post, Timbermaw Hold, Moonglade ---------------------------------------------------------

map Felwood
accept 4741
tip Trull Failbane stands at the north end of the post.
accept 6031 at 65.7,2.8
tip Ride north up the road to Timbermaw Hold, at the top of Felwood. Meilosh stands inside, in the first hall.
map Moonglade
fpath 12740
tip Take the branch of the tunnel to Moonglade. Faustron waits on the west side of the lake.
turnin 1123
accept 1124 5527
tip Both are for Silithus, the next guide: keep them.

