# East of Everlook: the Winterfall village, the yetis, the owlbeasts ---------------------------------

map Winterspring
do 4809 bg
do 92859 bg
tip Every chimaera can drop an Uncracked Chillwind Horn and Chillwind Chimaera Fur; every owl and screecher drops feathers. Kill them whenever they are in your way, all over the zone.
do 6031 bg mobs 7438 7439 7440 7441 7442 at 67.0,37.0
tip Winterfall furbolgs drop plenty of Runecloth: keep it for Meilosh and Rumstag.
do 8464
tip The Winterfall village lies just east of Everlook. One furbolg in about thirty drops a Winterfall Ritual Totem.
do 5121
tip High Chief Winterfall is a level 59 elite at the back of the cave above the village, with guards: clear your way in and fight him together. Kill his shamans first; his Frost Shock hits hard, so keep cooldowns for him.
accept 5123
tip Loot his Crudely-written Log and open it.
accept 8471
tip No totem yet? Keep killing Winterfall: the western camps on your way later have more of them.
do 977
tip Only the Ice Thistle Matriarchs and Patriarchs, on the hill just south of the village, drop Pristine Yeti Horns.
do 4741
tip The Moontouched Owlbeasts live in Owl Wing Thicket, north-east of Everlook. Their Moonfire hits hard and they heal themselves with Rejuvenation: interrupt or burst them.

# Everlook -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 977
accept 5163
tip Umi's Mechanical Yeti: scare three goblins with it. Legacki is here in Everlook; Sprinkle in Gadgetzan and Quixxil at Marshal's Refuge come at the end of this guide, and Silithus (59-60) brings it back to Umi.
do 5163.1 icon use "Use the Mechanical Yeti on Legacki"
tip Legacki is in Everlook.

