# South of Everlook: Brumeran, Hailspite, the Frostmaul giants -------------------------------------

map Winterspring
do 5055
tip Brumeran is a level 58 elite chimaera who glides among the chimaeras south of Everlook.
do 97490
tip Hailspite, a level 60 elite giant, walks the hills of southern Winterspring.
do 969
tip The Frostmaul Shards glitter on the ground around the outer edge of Frostwhisper Gorge, among the level 59-60 elite Frostmaul giants. Lure a giant away from a shard (a pet helps), grab it and run; it's hard for two, so skip it if it goes badly.

